# ── Search engine indexing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# When unset or any value other than "true", the site sends:
#   - robots metadata: noindex, nofollow
#   - /robots.txt: Disallow: /
#   - X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow (on every response)
# The site remains publicly accessible — only search-engine crawling is blocked.
# Set to "true" only on the production domain once the library is ready to launch.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_INDEXING=
